insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('1ec9e213-25a0-596d-a82b-263bfd8a0433', 'wg6-paragraph-transitions-p03', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g6-paragraph-transitions'), null,
        '6-8', $q$The Snow Shovel Crew$q$, $q$(1) Last winter, my friends and I started a group called the Snow Shovel Crew. (2) Our street has many older neighbors who find it hard to clear their own sidewalks. (3) Our first job came after a heavy storm dropped almost a foot of snow overnight in January. (4) The next morning, five of us grabbed shovels and knocked on doors. (5) We cleared six walkways before lunch, and Mr. Okafor brought us mugs of hot cocoa.

(6) Running the crew taught us how to work as a team. (7) At first, everyone shoveled wherever they wanted, and we kept bumping into each other. (8) Then Priya suggested that two people shovel while a third person sprinkled salt behind them. (9) My favorite winter activity is sledding down the hill behind the library. (10) After we tried her plan, we finished each walkway in half the time. (11) ____, we could clear the whole block in a single morning.$q$, 'draft')
