   $q$Which transition best fills the blank at the beginning of sentence 5?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Little by little,","is_correct":true},{"text":"Instead,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contrast-for-sequence"},{"text":"For example,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"example-for-sequence"},{"text":"In contrast,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contrast-for-sequence"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Little by little,$q$, $q$Sentence 4 says vapor keeps freezing onto the corners as the crystal falls, so the arms grow slowly over time, and "Little by little" shows that. "Instead" is wrong because the arms grow from the corners, not in place of them.$q$, 'draft', 'b29390a6-cef7-55b0-b93f-e32aff1127e5')
